($$SRD_2014$$, $$elven-chain-2014$$, $$Elven Chain$$, $$Cota de Malha Élfica$$, $$MAGIC$$, $$Armadura$$, $$RARE$$, FALSE, $$—$$, $$—$$, $$Armor (Cota de Malha or Cota de malha parcial), Rare   You gain a +1 bonus to Armor Class while you wear this armor. You are considered trained with this armor even if you lack training with Medium or Heavy armor.  @Embed[Compendium.dnd5e.content24.JournalEntry.dmgFoundryRefere.JournalEntryPage.Ok4iCgD25ENgoRxE cite=false caption=false classes="hide-in-embed"]$$, $$SRD$$),
