($$SRD_2014$$, $$feather-token-bird-2014$$, $$Bird Feather Token$$, $$Bird Feather Token$$, $$MAGIC$$, $$Item Maravilhoso$$, $$RARE$$, FALSE, $$—$$, $$—$$, $$Wondrous item, rare

This tiny object looks like a feather.

You can use an action to toss the token 5 feet into the air. The token disappears and an enormous, multicolored bird takes its place. The bird has the statistics of a roc, but it obeys your simple commands and can't attack. It can carry up to 500 pounds while flying at its maximum speed (16 miles an hour for a maximum of 144 miles per day, with a one-hour rest for every 3 hours of flying), or 1,000 pounds at half that speed. The bird disappears after flying its maximum distance for a day or if it drops to 0 hit points. You can dismiss the bird as an action.$$, $$SRD$$),
($$SRD_2024$$, $$feather-token-bird-2024$$, $$Bird Feather Token$$, $$Bird Feather Token$$, $$MAGIC$$, $$Item Maravilhoso$$, $$RARE$$, FALSE, $$—$$, $$—$$, $$Wondrous item, rare

