($$SRD_2014$$, $$feather-token-fan-2014$$, $$Fan Feather Token$$, $$Fan Feather Token$$, $$MAGIC$$, $$Item Maravilhoso$$, $$RARE$$, FALSE, $$—$$, $$—$$, $$Wondrous item, rare

