If you are on a boat or ship, you can use an action to toss the token up to 10 feet in the air. The token disappears, and a giant flapping fan takes its place. The fan floats and creates a wind strong enough to fill the sails of one ship, increasing its speed by 5 miles per hour for 8 hours. You can dismiss the fan as an action.$$, $$SRD$$),
($$SRD_2024$$, $$feather-token-fan-2024$$, $$Fan Feather Token$$, $$Fan Feather Token$$, $$MAGIC$$, $$Item Maravilhoso$$, $$RARE$$, FALSE, $$—$$, $$—$$, $$Wondrous item, rare

