($$SRD_2014$$, $$feather-token-tree-2014$$, $$Tree Feather Token$$, $$Tree Feather Token$$, $$MAGIC$$, $$Item Maravilhoso$$, $$RARE$$, FALSE, $$—$$, $$—$$, $$Wondrous item, rare

