($$SRD_2024$$, $$feather-token-tree-2024$$, $$Tree Feather Token$$, $$Tree Feather Token$$, $$MAGIC$$, $$Item Maravilhoso$$, $$RARE$$, FALSE, $$—$$, $$—$$, $$Wondrous item, rare

